1788559054.786 14:57:34 RECV method=tools/call id=2 params={"name": "ask_user", "arguments": {"questions": [{"question": "Question 1 of the interview \u2014 the shape of the app today.\n\nWhat are the clients and where does note data live right now? Specifically:\n\n- Which platforms ship today (web SPA, iOS/Android native, Electron/desktop, more than one)?\n- Where is the source of truth (server DB + REST/GraphQL API? Firebase/Supabase? already local-first?)\n- Is there any local persistence at all today (IndexedDB, SQLite, Core Data), or is it fetch-on-load with an in-memory store?\n- Roughly what's the note payload \u2014 plain text/Markdown blobs, or a structured rich-text doc (ProseMirror/Lexical/blocks)? And are attachments in scope?\n\nFree-form is fine; the options below are just common shapes.", "options": ["Web SPA only, server DB behind a REST API, no local persistence, Markdown notes", "Web + mobile clients, server DB behind an API, some caching, rich-text/block documents", "Mobile-first native app with a local DB already, syncing to a server", "Something else \u2014 I'll describe it"]}]}, "_meta": {"claudecode/toolUseId": "toolu_01PEtjebuEdt7wp2Nz2Ap9Cz", "progressToken": 2}}
